{% extends 'admin/sourcing/base.html.twig' %}
{% set page_title = 'Mapping visuel Realisaprint — ' ~ route.yoowiiProductCode %}
{% block sourcing_actions %}<a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="{{ path('yoowii_admin_sourcing_dashboard') }}">Retour sourcing</a>{% endblock %}
{% block sourcing_content %}
<div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-xl-9 col-xxl-8">
<div class="alert alert-info">Chaque ligne relie une option canonique Yoowii à une variable Realisaprint. La version créée est inactive : elle ne peut ni coter ni rendre le produit visible.</div>
{{ form_start(form, {attr: {class: 'sourcing-form'}}) }}{{ form_errors(form) }}
<section class="card mb-4"><div class="card-header"><div><h2 class="card-title mb-1">Contexte du mapping</h2><div class="text-secondary small">Référence fournisseur et version immuable du brouillon.</div></div></div><div class="card-body"><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="form-label">Produit Yoowii</span></div><div class="col-lg-8"><code>{{ route.yoowiiProductCode }}</code></div></div><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="form-label">Référence fournisseur</span></div><div class="col-lg-8"><code>{{ route.supplierProduct.code }}</code></div></div>{% include 'admin/sourcing/_field.html.twig' with {field: form.version} only %}{% include 'admin/sourcing/_field.html.twig' with {field: form.stock} only %}</div></section>
<section class="card mb-4"><div class="card-header"><div><h2 class="card-title mb-1">Correspondance des variables</h2><div class="text-secondary small">Les valeurs doivent correspondre aux valeurs canoniques Yoowii ; <code>catalog_values</code> permet de renseigner une quantité sans table de valeurs.</div></div></div><div class="card-body">{{ form_widget(form.variables) }}{{ form_errors(form.variables) }}</div></section>
<details class="card mb-4"><summary class="card-header"><div><h2 class="card-title mb-1">Configuration API lue</h2><div class="text-secondary small">Lecture seule, fournie par la synchronisation Realisaprint.</div></div></summary><div class="card-body"><pre class="sourcing-json-preview font-monospace small mb-0">{{ catalog_product.configuration|json_encode(constant('JSON_PRETTY_PRINT') b-or constant('JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE')) }}</pre></div></details>
{% include 'admin/sourcing/_form_actions.html.twig' with {cancel_url: path('yoowii_admin_sourcing_dashboard'), submit_label: 'Enregistrer le mapping brouillon'} only %}{{ form_rest(form) }}{{ form_end(form, {render_rest: false}) }}
</div></div>
{% endblock %}
